## Widget id: tsb.livedoc.matrix.v1

Version 1.0<br/>

<ul>
	<li><b>Data Set</b> — Documents (single project). Query selects LiveDocs for rows.</li>
	<li><b>Work Item Type</b> — Type counted inside each document.</li>
	<li><b>Column Enumeration</b> — status, severity, or custom enum (when Use Column Queries is off).</li>
	<li><b>Use Column Queries</b> — Define columns with title + Lucene instead of enumeration.</li>
	<li><b>Show Row Total Column</b> — Sum of all column counts per document.</li>
	<li><b>Show Footer Totals Row</b> — Sum of each column across all documents.</li>
	<li><b>Exclude Headings</b> — Omit heading work items from counts.</li>
	<li><b>Show Empty Documents</b> — Include rows where every count is zero.</li>
</ul>

Deploy folder name must be <code>tsb.livedoc.matrix.v1</code>. See <code>new-widget-1/TEST-IN-POLARION.md</code>.
